# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Python RAG Agent Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials
# All variables marked as REQUIRED must be set for the application to start

# ── ChromaDB Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
CHROMA_PATH=./chroma_db
CHROMA_COLLECTION=pan_portal

# ── Embedding & Reranking Models ───────────────────────────────────────────
EMBED_MODEL=BAAI/bge-m3
RERANKER_MODEL=BAAI/bge-reranker-base

# ── NVIDIA NIM API (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your API key from: https://build.nvidia.com/
# Used for: LLM inference (Llama 3.3 70B), STT (Whisper), TTS (Magpie)
NVIDIA_API_KEY=your_nvidia_api_key_here
NVIDIA_BASE_URL=https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1
LLM_MODEL=meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct

# ── Voice Agent API Keys (NVIDIA NIM for STT and TTS) ──────────────────────
# These can use the same NVIDIA_API_KEY or separate keys if needed
# STT: openai/whisper-large-v3 via NVIDIA NIM
# TTS: nvidia/magpie-tts-multilingual via NVIDIA NIM
STT_API_KEY=your_nvidia_api_key_here
TTS_API_KEY=your_nvidia_api_key_here

# ── Upstash Redis (REQUIRED) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://console.upstash.com/redis
# Used for: context cache, flow state, agent memory
# MUST be the SAME Redis instance as Node backend for memory consistency
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-redis-url.upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_upstash_token_here

# ── Supabase (REQUIRED) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
# Used for: user profile persistence, application data storage
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CRITICAL NOTES:
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. NO LOCAL FALLBACKS: This application REQUIRES Upstash Redis.
#    If credentials are missing or invalid, the server will raise EnvironmentError.
#
# 2. SHARED REDIS: The Upstash Redis credentials MUST match the Node backend
#    to ensure memory consistency across the system.
#
# 3. MEMORY ISOLATION: All memory is isolated per user_id. Redis keys are
#    scoped as: ctx:{user_id}:{session_id}, flow:details:{user_id}:{session_id}
#
# 4. SECURITY: Never commit .env files to version control. Keep credentials secret.
#
# 5. STARTUP VALIDATION: The MemoryManager validates Upstash credentials on
#    initialization and will raise EnvironmentError if missing or invalid.
